    "dislikesCount": 0,
    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Desmembramento de lan&#231;amento</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 24/07/2025 14:43</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"updated-info\">Atualizado por Thomaz Queiroz em 16/03/2026 17:33</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\" draggable=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zQ7czc0siOc?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" height=\"360\" width=\"640\" class=\"fr-draggable\"></iframe></span><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Existem lan&ccedil;amentos que possuem um &uacute;nico hist&oacute;rico, mas que s&atilde;o situa&ccedil;&otilde;es que devem ser individualizadas na contabilidade. Abaixo um exemplo de um tipo de lan&ccedil;amento, cujo nome do hist&oacute;rico &eacute; padr&atilde;o, no entanto, &eacute; preciso desmembrar pra levar para a contabilidade.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/CC5172CD75DBADA424B1861AAE106622.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Para resolver essa necessidade, voc&ecirc; deve clicar com o bot&atilde;o direito do mouse sobre o lan&ccedil;amento e ir na op&ccedil;&atilde;o Desmembrar Valores. Esse lan&ccedil;amento N&Atilde;O &eacute; feito no m&oacute;dulo Concilia&ccedil;&atilde;o, &eacute; feito na tela principal (na grid).</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/044603CA240DD9B513DF1508CAB12548.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Ao clicar, o sistema abrir&aacute; a tela abaixo. Voc&ecirc; pode alterar o hist&oacute;rico, caso desejar, pode informar o valor que deseja, informar os dados cont&aacute;beis e depois clicar no &iacute;cone de confirma&ccedil;&atilde;o para inserir.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/1004CAA86F2E22B4CAF525397A3657CF.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Ap&oacute;s &eacute; s&oacute; fazer a mesma coisa com o valor restante at&eacute; zerar o saldo que <strong>Falta</strong> e clicar em <strong>Concluir</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/9315D45D6B645B4BD9AA6A05D266C939.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Esse recurso pode ser muito &uacute;til, por exemplo, para separa&ccedil;&atilde;o de juros/multas e etc em lan&ccedil;amentos banc&aacute;rios. Pode ser muito &uacute;til para identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o de fornecedores em pagamentos banc&aacute;rios e etc.</span></p><p><br></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545273/primeiros-passos?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Primeiros passos</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545661/layouts?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro de Layouts</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
