    "viewCount": 60,
    "likesCount": 12,
    "dislikesCount": 0,
    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Duplica&#231;&#227;o de Layout</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 22/07/2025 15:44</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"updated-info\">Atualizado por Thomaz Queiroz em 02/04/2026 16:58</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"><iframe class=\"fr-draggable\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/SzB50EGAEYE?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></span><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>Para duplicar um layout, siga os passos abaixo:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">1) Acesse o cadastro de layout clicando na aba Cadastros &gt; Layouts</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/EF14C43743EF2B51B01ECF89DF5209CC.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2) Localize o layout que deseja duplicar. Ap&oacute;s localizar, clique no &iacute;cone <strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Duplicar. ATEN&Ccedil;&Atilde;O&nbsp;</strong>ao c&oacute;digo do layout. As vezes o nome pode ser semelhante, mas n&atilde;o trata-se realmente do que voc&ecirc; precisa.<strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">3) Ao clicar no &iacute;cone <strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Duplicar</strong>, ser&aacute; aberta uma tela para voc&ecirc; informar o nome do novo layout que ser&aacute; criado.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Ex.: SICOOB - RODRIGO LTDA - CC 123</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/5D9BCD8D99E8C9BC20FA6EFDCC14A4F0.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Pronto! Agora &eacute; s&oacute; vincular a empresa e em seguida, importar o seu arquivo.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545273/primeiros-passos?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Primeiros passos</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/article/545661/layouts?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro de Layouts</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
