    "viewCount": 36,
    "likesCount": 10,
    "dislikesCount": 0,
    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Reexportando a movimenta&#231;&#227;o</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 23/07/2025 17:35</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"updated-info\">Atualizado por Thomaz Queiroz em 17/03/2026 08:11</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p id=\"isPasted\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Uma vez que um arquivo foi exportado, consigo exportar novamente?</span></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\" draggable=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5IJ8K8pgxp8?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" height=\"360\" width=\"640\" class=\"fr-draggable\"></iframe></span></span></strong><br></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Sim! Voc&ecirc; consegue...aqui vc consegue quase tudo.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Ap&oacute;s fazer a exporta&ccedil;&atilde;o, o sistema marca os lan&ccedil;amentos que foram exportados, conforme abaixo.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/1F143F5E8E0FE69C4882AB96D205C04F.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Para fazer uma nova exporta&ccedil;&atilde;o, basta clicar no &iacute;cone <strong>Exportar&nbsp;</strong>e ficar atento a mensagem abaixo:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/D261640335AB70462444053F179BDC1C.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Se voc&ecirc; clicar em <strong>SIM</strong>, o sistema levar&aacute; apenas lan&ccedil;amento ainda n&atilde;o exportados, ou seja: lan&ccedil;amentos que n&atilde;o est&atilde;o marcados como exportados, conforme imagem acima.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Se voc&ecirc; clicar em <strong>N&Atilde;O</strong>, o sistema gerar&aacute; arquivo contendo toda a movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o. Essa segunda op&ccedil;&atilde;o &eacute; a mais utilizada pelos nossos clientes.</span></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545273/primeiros-passos?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Primeiros passos</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545661/layouts?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro de Layouts</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
