    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Como excluir lan&#231;amentos?</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 23/07/2025 14:48</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Na tela principal do sistema h&aacute; um &iacute;cone que permite que voc&ecirc; exclua o(s) lan&ccedil;amento(s) desejado.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">IMPORTANTE:</strong> pode excluir sem medo, pois o sistema n&atilde;o apagar&aacute; as concilia&ccedil;&otilde;es realizadas anteriormente. Apagar&aacute; apenas as informa&ccedil;&otilde;es que constam na tela principal.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">1) excluindo apenas um lan&ccedil;amento:&nbsp;</strong>ap&oacute;s selecionar o lan&ccedil;amento que deseja excluir, clique na aba Movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o e clique no &iacute;cone Deletar.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><img src=\"/article-images/0EF1F476092D7744A0E316160225A5ED.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></strong></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong style=\"font-weight: 700;\">2) excluindo lan&ccedil;amentos alternados:&nbsp;</strong>mantenha a tecla CTRL do teclado pressionada e v&aacute; clicando os lan&ccedil;amentos que deseja excluir. Ap&oacute;s concluir a sele&ccedil;&atilde;o dos lan&ccedil;amentos que deseja excluir, clique na aba Movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o e clique no &iacute;cone Deletar.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/627263C28D13A4B2DA8978D0087B16B3.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>3) </strong><strong>excluindo v&aacute;rios lan&ccedil;amentos cont&iacute;nuos:</strong> para selecionar v&aacute;rios lan&ccedil;amentos continuamente, pressione SHIFT no teclado e com a setinha do teclado mova para cima ou para baixo e assim selecionar&aacute;.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/121792AFBC5EED2A5191729C9DCF1B71.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>4) </strong>Ap&oacute;s realizar a sele&ccedil;&atilde;o desejada e clicar no bot&atilde;o Deletar, basta clicar em Sim na tela de confirma&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></p><p style=\"font-size: 12px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/2E56E0A8474F5453C644D565D966F252.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><p><br></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545273/primeiros-passos?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Primeiros passos</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545661/layouts?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro de Layouts</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
