    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Visualizador</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 11/07/2025 16:02</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"updated-info\">Atualizado por Thomaz Queiroz em 16/03/2026 17:31</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\" draggable=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dy9s3fbscOs?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" height=\"360\" width=\"640\" class=\"fr-draggable\"></iframe></span><br></p><p><br></p><p id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Clicando nessa op&ccedil;&atilde;o, &eacute; poss&iacute;vel ter acesso ao arquivo importado (PDF) sem precisar abrir o arquivo por fora do sistema.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Para acessar a funcionalidade, clique em Movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o e depois em Visualizador</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/D6304785DEB4BCEF28BE5A6AE0478844.png\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Ao clicar em Visualizador, se o arquivo em PDF ainda existir no diret&oacute;rio que foi importado, ele ser&aacute; mostrado na tela dentro do sistema. Dessa maneira, fica mais f&aacute;cil para realizar confer&ecirc;ncias, por exemplo.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" src=\"/article-images/9BDA7BBDCC399A63F6B3C967805780F1.png\"></span></p><p><br></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545273/primeiros-passos?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Primeiros passos</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545661/layouts?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro de Layouts</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
