    "dislikesCount": 0,
    "contentHtml": "<header class=\"md-article-header\">\r\n                <div class=\"md-article-title\" id=\"article-title\">Cadastrar Feriados</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"read-info\">1 min</div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"created-info\">Criado por Thomaz Queiroz em 11/07/2025 15:59</div>\r\n                    <div class=\"updated-info\">Atualizado por Thomaz Queiroz em 17/03/2026 08:09</div>\r\n\r\n            </header>\r\n                <div class=\"article-content fr-view\"><p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\" draggable=\"true\" contenteditable=\"false\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aoqtQKeSVM4?&wmode=opaque&rel=0\" height=\"360\" width=\"640\" class=\"fr-draggable\"></iframe></span><br></p><p><br></p><p id=\"isPasted\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Imagine o seguinte cen&aacute;rio:&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">O banco Bradesco fornece um relat&oacute;rio de liquida&ccedil;&atilde;o o qual cont&eacute;m uma data de recebimento, no entanto, a data cont&aacute;bil, a data que houve de fato a movimenta&ccedil;&atilde;o financeira &eacute; sempre 1 dia ap&oacute;s a data constante no arquivo (D+1).</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">O cadastro de feriados dentro do sistema tem a finalidade de atender essa situa&ccedil;&atilde;o.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1) Para cadastrar um feriado, acesse Cadastros e depois clique em Feriados.</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/94C8554A544F276B804B36D17BBAD69F.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>2) Ap&oacute;s abrir a tela de cadastro</strong></span></p><ol><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Clique em Novo</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Defina o Feriado como Ativo para ser considerado nas importa&ccedil;&otilde;es</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Informe uma Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o para melhorar a identifica&ccedil;&atilde;o</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Selecione o tipo do Feriado</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Informe a Data deste Feriado de acordo com o Tipo</li><li style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Clique em Salvar</li></ol><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"/article-images/354DAA45453D558B8A76B8107C60AA16.png\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">Com o cadastro de feriados, situa&ccedil;&otilde;es onde existem a necessidade desse controle, o sistema controlar&aacute;.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"fr-emoticon fr-deletable\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\">😉</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p></div>\r\n            <footer class=\"article-footer\">\r\n                <!-- Attachments -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- Rating -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- Rating -->\r\n<div class=\"satisfaction-survey-container\">\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"label-rating\">\r\n        <h5><strong>O que voc&#234; achou deste artigo?</strong></h5>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div id=\"rating-box\" class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-form\">\r\n                        <div class=\"content\">\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"1\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    Sim\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-like\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"kb-article-evaluation-positive-negative\">\r\n                                <label class=\"satisfaction-survey-positive-kb\">\r\n                                    <input class=\"satisfaction-survey-item-radio\" type=\"radio\"\r\n                                           value=\"2\"\r\n                                           name=\"ArticleEvaluationPositiveNegativeResponse\" />\r\n                                    N&#227;o\r\n                                    <i class=\"icon-mv-dislike\"></i>\r\n                                </label>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                        </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"rating-box-confirm\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n            <h5><strong>Obrigado pela sua avalia&#231;&#227;o.</strong></h5>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div id=\"show-fields-feedback\" style=\"display: none\"></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n                <!-- Related Articles -->\r\n\r\n                <!-- AccessHistory -->\r\n                <div class=\"panel panel-default\" id=\"last-visited-articles\" style=\"\">\r\n                    <div class=\"panel-heading\">&#218;ltimos artigos visitados</div>\r\n                    <ul class=\"list-group\">\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545649/cadastro-de-usuarios?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Usu&#225;rios</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545658/empresas?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Empresas</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545660/contabilidade?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastro da Contabilidade</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545665/compartilhamento-de-regras?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Criando Compartilhamento de Regras</a></li>\r\n                            <li class=\"list-group-item\"><a class=\"kb-article-to-article-hyperlink\" href=\"https://conciliador-contabil2.movidesk.com/kb/pt-br/article/545666/clientes-fornecedores?ticketId=&amp;q=\">Cadastrar Clientes/Fornecedores</a></li>\r\n                    </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n            </footer>",
